#
# libde265 plugin tests (WI-0.014, WI-2.162). Catch2's CHECK/REQUIRE macros expand to branches, so a test that
# walks every block of a picture trips readability-function-cognitive-complexity on code with little control flow
# of its own. Count only the test's own branches (as core/tests/bitreader/.clang-tidy does).
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.IgnoreMacros: true
